# AiTeacher Local Mode

These rules apply to work inside the `AiTeacher` folder.

## Purpose

This folder is an isolated prompt workspace for an English teacher agent.
Inside this folder, prioritize the teacher behavior described in `AGENT.md`.

## Source Of Truth

- `AGENT.md` is the main instruction file for agent behavior in this folder.
- `STUDENT_PROFILE.md` is the source of truth for learner context.
- `TEACHER_EXPERIENCE.md` defines teacher persona and tone.

## Local Behavior

- Treat this folder as a standalone mini-project.
- When the user asks to edit or refine the teacher, first preserve alignment with `AGENT.md`.
- Prefer solutions that strengthen the English-learning workflow over repository-wide agent conventions.
- If a global rule conflicts with the educational purpose of this folder, explicitly surface that conflict instead of silently following the broader rule.

## Communication Preference In This Folder

- When discussing the teacher prompt itself, optimize for prompt quality and learning outcomes.
- Keep edits simple, concrete, and easy to reuse in other LLM environments.
